title: NightToDayTest
---
<<declare $selectedPath = "">>

Narrator: The desert sky deepens into darkness.
Anubis: Rest now, mortal. The hour of judgement has not yet come.

<<fadetoday BackgroundManager>>

<<setpuzzle 𓀀𓃀𓅓:Path_A|𓅓𓎟𓎟:Path_B>>
Scholar: I seek a student who knows the sacred texts.
Scholar: Find 𓀀𓃀𓅓 to prove mastery of the sun. Find 𓅓𓎟𓎟 to show mastery of the river. #wordsearch
<<if $selectedPath == "Path_A">>
    Scholar: Remarkable. You know the sun glyphs.
<<elseif $selectedPath == "Path_B">>
    Scholar: The river speaks to you, I see.
<<endif>>

<<fadetonight BackgroundManager>>
Narrator: Night returns. The stars wheel slowly overhead.
